What is Adaptive Traffic Signal Control System?
Adaptive Traffic Signal Control System leverages real time data from road side sensors, video analytics cameras and connected vehicle streams to dynamically adjust traffic light phases. Unlike fixed time controllers, these systems optimize signal timing on the fly, enhancing vehicle flow, reducing travel time, and cutting fuel consumption and emissions. The technology serves as a pivotal component of modern smart city traffic management platforms.
